                                        "entry_id": "b1ae4c3a-663f-3236-a695-bf86a4ed1c0d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A lighthearted or humorous item used to round off a news broadcast."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cd485a8-ae09-4896-b224-d1fbc86e916c",
                                                "sense_id": "ec0bc2c6-08d8-3a28-80cf-592b49061638",
                                                "text": "[…] international news and politics, and heavy on the light stuff: local news, entertainment and merry little kickers […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e375811e-103f-4225-887f-30b795ce5d35",
                                                "sense_id": "ec0bc2c6-08d8-3a28-80cf-592b49061638",
                                                "text": "Instead, a reporter can carve out a niche as an entertainment/community reporter, thus concentrating their efforts on filing feature stories for the E block, where the kickers are slated. Kickers are feel-good pieces placed at the end of the newscast to leave viewers in a good mood […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
